<title>FRANCE: Turkey to tender for feed, malting barley export.</title>
<headline>Turkey to tender for feed, malting barley export.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey will tender on February 3 to export 150,000 tonnes of feed barley and 50,000 tonnes of malting barley, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The barley is for shipment in February and March, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
